### 返修工单-记录维修结果
POST {{baseUrl}}/reworkOrder/{{demoReworkId}}/repair
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": {{repairId}},
  "status": 2,
  "repairAction": "更换异常轴体并复测",
  "replacedMaterial": "MAT-SWITCH-001 x1",
  "repairHours": 0.5,
  "repairResult": "已修复，待复检",
  "repairTime": "2026-07-14T15:30:00"
}

### 返修工单-复检通过并关闭返修
POST {{baseUrl}}/reworkOrder/{{demoReworkId}}/recheck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inspectionNo": "RQ-20260714-001",
  "inspectorId": {{inspectorId}},
  "sourceType": "manual",
  "inspectionTime": "2026-07-14T16:00:00",
  "result": 1,
  "measuredData": "{\"pass\":true}",
  "approvalStatus": 0,
  "remark": "返修复检通过"
}
